<title>SWITZERLAND: Winterthur has no comment on ING.</title>
<headline>Winterthur has no comment on ING.</headline>
<dateline>WINTERTHUR, Switzerland 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Winterthur Insurance Co. declined comment on Amsterdam market rumours that Dutch financial group Internationale Nederlanden Groep NV (ING) was interested in buying it.</p>
<p>&quot;We do not comment on market rumours as a matter of principle,&quot; a Winterthur spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>Swiss Exchange traders said they had not heard the rumours, which helped boost ING shares by 0.70 to 54.70 guilders.</p>
<p>Winterthur closed 0.5 percent higher at 778 Swiss francs versus a 0.3 percent rise in the Swiss Market Index (SMI).</p>
<p>-- Zurich Newsroom, +41-1-631 7340</p>
